    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> . If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is such that <math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> , then <math> <mrow> <mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"> <munderover> <mo>&#8721;</mo> <mrow> <mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>10</mn> </mrow> </munderover> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo> </mrow> </mstyle> </mrow> </math> is equal to:",
